// k8s.io/kubernetes requires its staging modules at v0.0.0 and replaces them in
// its own go.mod, which Go ignores for dependencies. Pin every one so that
// `go list -m all` (IDEs, govulncheck) can resolve the full module graph.
// Bump these together with k8s.io/kubernetes.
replace (
	k8s.io/api => k8s.io/api v0.37.2
